# 🍳 Recipe Management REST API

A fully functional CRUD application for managing recipes, built using **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **MongoDB (Mongoose)** following the **MVC (Model-View-Controller)** architectural pattern.

## 🚀 Tech Stack
* **Runtime:** Node.js
* **Framework:** Express.js
* **Database:** MongoDB & Mongoose
* **API Testing & Docs:** Postman


## 📌 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **GET**    |   `/api/recipes`     | Retrieve all recipes |
| **GET**    |   `/api/recipes/:id` | Retrieve a single recipe by ID |
| **POST**   |   `/api/recipes`     | Create a new recipe |
| **PUT**    |   `/api/recipes/:id` | Update an existing recipe |
| **DELETE** |   `/api/recipes/:id` | Remove a recipe by ID |



